  "scope": {
    "definition_quote": {
      "value": "\"Provide electrical services\" means to provide any service in the electrical trade. \"Provide electrical services\" includes installing, repairing, maintaining, erecting, or altering any electrical equipment, wiring, fixture, appliance, apparatus, raceway, conduit, or system that: (i) generates, transmits, transforms, or uses electrical energy in any form for light, heat, power, or communication; and (ii) is located within a plant, substation, or elsewhere.",
